{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"9c3ef56ace717ce577247d75530aeddab49419f7d3acae5a3b0f00c3d3a286b5","ja":"エブリタイム★ハロウィン","zh":"永远的★万圣节","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"9b108f375a8cb203cff8f80bf2035c7665847ba48bbfb4e8bef516cb297ef35f","ja":"まずい……まずいよ麗花ちゃん！\nこのままじゃ茜ちゃん達、とんだピエロだよ！","zh":"不妙……不妙啊，丽花！这样下去，小茜他们可就成彻头彻尾的小丑了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a143adbe5252f484f7c6d077bd1c20d24901006cfa92b790fb7ad151bea08581","ja":"茜ちゃんのカワイさをもってしても、\nこの危機は乗り越えられないかも……。","zh":"即使凭借小茜的可爱，也可能无法度过这场危机……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"eaec5f6b063c43bfaed049227ea091360de2e584bd492b11a20d1bddc4a0ccc5","ja":"……うふふっ♪","zh":"……呵呵♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b1541029ab54e6121b20305924cbbb83e6b48203ad521ad85283555e6f844f6f","ja":"えっ！？　な、なんで笑ってるのさ！？\n茜ちゃんがこんなに困ってるのに～！！","zh":"诶！？ 为、为什么在笑啊！？\n小茜明明都这么为难了～！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"79e05f087087ef51c0f03b337749eab85f6ba0d3844c2f15f43b7d116204c6ad","ja":"ふふ、ごめんね。茜ちゃんって、\nほんとに面白いな～って思って♪","zh":"呵呵，抱歉呀。我只是觉得小茜真的很有意思～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d9dbc49a264df85b2a57038f909544a27f0fcae3f982462eb3b3561391a14bbb","ja":"次から次に楽しい顔が出てきて、びっくり箱みたい。\nやっぱり私、茜ちゃんとお仕事するの、大好きだな♪","zh":"一个接一个地露出开心的表情，简直像个惊喜箱。\n果然，我最喜欢和小茜一起工作了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d577839dc3f642282f693385466d73fa0b037a83752189cc72751516090b29a6","ja":"そう？　面と向かってほめられると照れちゃうな～。\n……あれ。ほめてる？　ほめてるよね？","zh":"是吗？被人当面夸奖的话，会让我害羞的啦～。\n……咦？你是在夸我吧？是在夸我对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6f74a0d0d619f3f6e4f76062079bc6e094435026db23a6523d6d85dd6d431123","ja":"うん！　びっくり箱ってドキドキするし、\nワクワクするでしょ？　ハロウィンも同じだよね♪","zh":"嗯！惊喜箱会让人心跳加速，也会让人兴奋，对吧？万圣节也是一样的呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"10b267623f04f4aed221767ed7839ba39134f6747bc6f4943af027b6c61a6efd","ja":"茜ちゃんが……ハロウィンと同じ……ハッ！！\nそうか！　分かったよ、麗花ちゃん！！","zh":"小茜和……万圣节一样……哈！！\n原来如此！我明白了，丽花！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d650190f15e89ff09271c016c7d561ddefad1caf8c6f9f7424a8e6226be8416e","ja":"えっ？　なにが分かったの？","zh":"咦？你发现什么了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"61c586e1a8f71acc03851dd1e335e2fce5de068ecd2723ea3d22f311c62f6d7c","ja":"ハロウィンだから『TRICK&TREAT』が\nいるんじゃないんだよ。むしろその逆！","zh":"并不是因为万圣节才有《TRICK&TREAT》哦。恰恰相反！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"cf11c12757eae6b1728b32672360bdace5d6e268ee79fa2fc181902075c53674","ja":"『TRICK&TREAT』がいれば……\nそこがハロウィンになるんだよっ！！","zh":"只要有《TRICK&TREAT》在……\n那里就会变成万圣节哦！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"504fd4be0eee0c66ef741fd48cf425c0471cb817b55f06c977e4fbe23c89aa43","ja":"そっか～っ♪　それじゃあ私達は、何も気にしないで、\n思いっきり楽しめばいいんだね♪","zh":"原来如此～♪ 那我们就什么都不用在意，尽情享受就好啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"8e5f524902764bd54e2a1740b3e0d9b18ddc01cc20a27d7130f8fc4e19447e1c","ja":"さすが、茜ちゃん♪\nわー、パチパチパチー！","zh":"不愧是小茜♪\n哇——啪啪啪啪！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6ef6073ce8ffcb11352fd73a24c8cdc98b9461d680c5cfc9aff1564eed3351ea","ja":"いやー、茜ちゃんの天才的なひらめきのおかげで無事\n解決できたよー。今夜のプリンはきっとおいしいねっ！","zh":"哎呀，多亏了小茜天才般的灵光一现，总算顺利解决了。  \n今晚的布丁肯定很好吃呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c60e80b36f68e2cc3c06591c37689a215b2e85c982e0d825b7131e4bf69b1063","ja":"うん、おいしかったよ！","zh":"嗯，很好吃哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b976f9a346a87339bcaa6de58173c5c7db96ccebaba524453bcf1c1a536aa9be","ja":"えっ……過去形？　それってまさか……。","zh":"咦……过去式？难道那是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_865.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"0b8b8ae5f6df3ad9213eced6336897571916d338102c3ebd960bc7648bf8b2a7","ja":"あ～っ！\nあ、茜ちゃんのプリンが～！？","zh":"啊～！\n啊，小茜的布丁要——！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
